  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Slice zucchini into rounds.\n• Cut red onion and tomato into wedges.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-8ff94000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place zucchini, onion and tomato on a second lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-2999eb10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are roasting, finely chop garlic.\n• Pick thyme leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-cd1fb520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add Nan's special seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-a907ac30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the saucepan, stir in risoni, stock concentrate, light cooking cream and the boiling water (see ingredients). Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium and simmer, stirring occasionally, until risoni is ‘al dente’ and water is absorbed, 12-15 minutes.\n• TIP: Rest risoni, covered, for 5 minutes to thicken.\n• TIP: Add a splash more water if the risoni looks dry!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-24944e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Gently stir roast veggies through risoni.\n• Divide risoni between bowls.\n• Top with roast pumpkin. Drizzle the honey over roast pumpkin.\n• Crumble over marinated goat cheese and garnish with thyme to serve. Enjoy!\n• TIP: Keeping a portion for later? See storage and re-heating instructions under allergens!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895829b6ffa7a20c3beb42/step-ccb6f350.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
